OR-Tools is Google's open source software suite for combinatorial
optimization: linear and mixed-integer programming, constraint
programming (CP-SAT), vehicle routing, scheduling, graph algorithms
and bin packing.

This SlackBuild builds the C++ library against the system abseil-cpp,
protobuf, re2 and eigen, without downloading anything at build time.
The bundled solvers (CP-SAT, GLOP, PDLP, BOP, ...) are always included.
The COIN-OR (Cbc/Clp), HiGHS and SCIP backends are disabled because they
are not available as packages. Python, Java and .NET bindings are not
built.

GLPK support (academic/glpk) is enabled automatically when glpk is
installed; to disable it:

  GLPK=no ./or-tools.SlackBuild
